{"repositoryId":818950381,"availability":"available","full":"ArtiGaund/studysprout","name":"studysprout","description":"\"AI-powered collaborative learning platform — PDF-to-structured-content parsing, real-time CRDT-based multi-user editing, auto-generated concept graphs, and Gemini-powered flashcards with spaced repetition and Java-based rate limiting. Next.js, TypeScript, MongoDB, Redis, BullMQ.\"","category":"Education","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2024-06-23T10:44:57Z","updated":"2026-10-16T02:06:42Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://www.studysprouts.in/","topics":["bullmq","concept-graph","crdt","d3js","gemini-api","java","mongodb","nextjs","pdf-parsing","rate-limiting","real-time-collaboration","redis","socketio","spaced-repetition","typescript","yjs"],"demo":"https://studysprouts.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:46.348Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:46.348Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:46.348Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T11:46:29.087Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-13T07:37:36.102Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:46.348Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Collaborative workspace for learning — write your own notes or drop in a PDF, and get AI-generated flashcards, spaced repetition, and automatic concept mapping either way.","Live Demo · Report a Bug · Contact Companion repo: studysprout-realtime-server — the standalone Socket.io + Yjs service that powers live collaboration, presence, and generation locking. Deployed and versioned separately; see its own README for the deep socket-architecture detail. Rate limiter: rate-limiter — standalone Java service enforcing per-user request limits on Gemini API calls (flashcard generation), preventing repeated-call abuse within a short time window. Browser extension: studysprout-clipper — Chrome (Manifest V3) extension for capturing web content into the Inbox.","Most students and researchers end up with a folder full of PDFs and scattered notes, and no real system for retaining what's in them. StudySprout is a collaborative, Notion-style workspace — write pages directly in a block-based editor, or upload a PDF and let it get parsed into structured pages for you. Either way, every file gets pulled into the same intelligence layer: terms get indexed, concepts get mapped across the folder, prerequisite relationships get detected, and AI-generated flashcards turn the content into something you actually study from, with spaced repetition tracking whether…"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArtiGaund/studysprout/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"e40faf57af5c7ac2b605fb7c50adc00d34fad4ff832f02c99b9411ef62096d84","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:29.265Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:46.468Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A Collaborative workspace for learning — write your own notes or drop in a PDF, and get AI-generated flashcards, spaced repetition, and automatic concept mapping either way.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArtiGaund/studysprout/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"No separate login for the extension — a save attempt while logged out stashes the capture locally and bridges through the site's normal sign-in flow, then flushes automatically once authenticated","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArtiGaund/studysprout/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Bridging auth between a website and a browser extension without building a second login system — a URL flag plus chrome.runtime.sendMessage from the web page into the extension, riding the existing NextAuth session cookie for all subsequent API calls rather than managing a separate token","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArtiGaund/studysprout/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e40faf57af5c7ac2b605fb7